  (text "U1 EN: per module datasheet, TBD (D36V50F5 has EN pulled up to VIN).\nD36V50F5 also has VRP and PG pins (not drawn); header pins are 3 A each,\nso VIN/VOUT/GND need two pins each. U1 footprint TBD.\nPlan asks 5.1 V, >=6 A; D36V50F5 is 5.0 V +/-4 %, 5.5 A typ (open Q4).\nReverse polarity protection TBD (P-FET or ideal diode, plan step 7);\nD36V50F5 itself has input reverse protection to 40 V (open Q6)." (at 203.2 126.49 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 91979d19-90f4-57f0-8c16-4509cf6e6704))
