  (text "ESP32 3V3 pin must not power these sensors (ESP32 powers nothing)." (at 160.02 259.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid f8e38210-8692-584f-97c9-121444315746))
  (rectangle (start 312.42 20.32) (end 410.21 228.6) (stroke (width 0) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid ebba6a69-5edd-51f7-a3da-b722d5b45219))
  (text "Notes" (at 314.96000000000004 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 2dd2af49-5c5b-52b4-9344-dba10dedde97))
  (text "1. Battery: 2S LiPo, 6.0-8.4 V (ESC LVC cuts at 6.0 V), XT60.\n2. All fuses and protection values TBD;\n   positions are proposals.\n3. Single common GND; star point at J1 in layout.\n4. +6V_BEC is ESC-supplied, isolated from 5 V rails.\n5. Signals are 3.3 V logic or lower.\n6. Rails are project power symbols (rc_power lib):\n   pin name = Value = net name (KiCad 7-10 safe).\n7. PWR_FLAG on VBAT_RAW, GND, VBAT, VIN_CPU,\n   VIN_SENS, LDO_IN, +6V_BEC.\n8. Net classes (kicad_pro): HighCurrent = VBAT*, GND;\n   Power5A = +5V_CPU, VIN_CPU;\n   Power3A = +5V_SENS, VIN_SENS, +6V_BEC.\n   20 A path: zones or off-board wire (open Q1).\n9. Spec: docs/schematics/power_board_plan.md.\n   Values marked TBD are unconfirmed." (at 314.96 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 3c33dfa6-f3ae-5169-9d85-f5eabb76b751))
